        "content": "<p>Update: As I noted later, there were some issues with my prior code, in particular with how it constructs the projection function application. Thinking about this further, this simplistic procedure also does not guarantee that diamonds are treated correctly. For instance, in the following:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">extends</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">extends</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">extends</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">C'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">extends</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B'</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">D</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">extends</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">C'</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">axiom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">D</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>We should have that <code>d.toB'.e</code> is equal to <code>d.toB.e</code>, but my above implementation does not handle this</p>",
